     "t": "Fabricate",
     "d": "Our welding operators, qualified to ASME Section IX, build to ASME BPE. Every product-contact weld and heat number goes into the weld log."
    },
    {
     "t": "Factory test",
     "d": "The engineers who wrote the functional specification run the wet FAT against the protocol you approved. Deviations close before the skid ships."
    },
    {
     "t": "Qualify",
     "d": "Our validation lead executes the site acceptance test (SAT) and installation and operational qualification (IQ/OQ). Your quality unit approves every protocol first."
    },
    {
     "t": "Service",
     "d": "Our technicians take over with the as-built drawings, the FAT results and the engineers who made them: maintenance, calibration, change control and requalification."
